sequenceDiagram
 participant C as Cliente/TestClient
 participant A as FastAPI ASGI
 participant P as Pydantic
 participant R as Repository
 C->>A: POST /items JSON
 A->>P: validar ItemCreate
 P-->>A: modelo válido ou 422
 A->>R: criar item
 R-->>A: Item
 A-->>C: 201 Created JSON
 C->>A: GET/DELETE /items/id
 A->>R: consultar/remover
 A-->>C: 200, 204 ou 404
